{"날짜": "2026-09-16", "시험지명": "태장고_고1_2025_2_중간", "루프ID": "20260916-CL-G1S-f84d14e4", "문항": {"7": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">집합 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x0007D;</mo></mrow></mrow></math>에 대하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x0007B;</mo><mi>X</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mi>X</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo>&#x02282;</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x0007D;</mo></mrow></mrow></math>라 할 때, 옳은 것만을 &lt;보기&gt;에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?</p><p><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"bl\">ㄱ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">&#x0007D;</mo></mrow><mo>&#x02208;</mo><mi>P</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\" /><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math></div><div class=\"bl\">ㄴ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007B;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">&#x0007B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretc